   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear R users of Davis and beyond,<div><br></div><div>I made a package that sends you a text message when a long running job completes. It requires a Twillio account (which has a free tier). </div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;d be honored if you check it out, share it, use it, and file bug reports if you&#39;re so inclined!</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/richpauloo/textme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/richpauloo/textme&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465747866000&amp;usg=AOvVaw109AIZ7z32EuTKThhjIEIT\">Github</a></div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://twitter.com/RichPauloo/status/1176373787022905344?s=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://twitter.com/RichPauloo/status/1176373787022905344?s%3D20&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465747866000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0I1U5U5a80JN5wfjvluzW4\">Twitter</a></div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Rich</div><div><br></div></div>\r\n"
