     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Well, yes. </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">But I always throw a <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">Sys.sleep(3600)</code> at the end of every long-running job before a <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">textme()</code>, just to ensure an extra hour of break time.</p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:V2VsbCwgeWVzLsKgPGRpdj48YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdj5CdXQgSSBhbHdheXMgdGhyb3cgYSBgU3lz\r\nLnNsZWVwKDM2MDApYCBhdCB0aGUgZW5kIG9mIGV2ZXJ5IGxvbmctcnVubmluZyBqb2IgYmVmb3Jl\r\nIGEgYHRleHRtZSgpYCwganVzdCB0byBlbnN1cmUgYW4gZXh0cmEgaG91ciBvZiBicmVhayB0aW1l\r\nLjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2Pg==\" style=\"min-height:0;width:0;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:0em;padding:0;margin:0\"></div></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
